# GRUB SHIFT: as in Bug Hunter, you may stop between contracts after a win
# and carry on later. Back at the title (or after closing the game) the next
# contract of the streak is offered first; only NEW CONTRACT or a lost
# contract ends the streak.
game grubshift
wait 5
cheat contract 1 7
cheat clear
cheat kills 29
cheat bug 3 2 1 0
cheat use 5 3 2
wait 150
expect streak == 1
press B
wait 10
expect state == 0
expect in_progress == 0
reload
game grubshift
wait 10
expect streak == 1
press A
wait 10
expect state == 1
expect contract == 2
expect streak == 1
wait 40
press A
wait 10
cheat clear
cheat kills 29
cheat bug 3 2 1 0
cheat use 5 3 2
wait 150
expect streak == 2
press B
wait 10
press DOWN
press A
wait 10
expect contract == 1
expect streak == 0
